      "note": [
        "1993–1996: Values for Skåne County (12) are a summation of Kristianstad County (11) and Malmöhus County (12). 1993–1997: Values for Västra Götaland County (14) are a summary of  Gothenburg County and Bohus County (14), Älvsborg County (15) and Skaraborg County (16). The 1995/96 budget year comprised 18 months (1 July 1995–31 December 1996). Values for Heby Municipality are presented with Västmanland County up to the end of 2006. From 2007 onwards the values for Heby Municipality are presented with Uppsala County, due to the change of county for the municipality. ",
        "Starting in 2015 information per county is missing. 2015: Area is excluding replacement land for protection of forests, as well as exchanges and sales."
